{"id": "t174-002", "text": "Louis is a die-hard Leeds fan and has had a season ticket since he was twelve. He also plays bass in a covers band on Thursdays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Leeds", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since he was twelve"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "plays bass in a covers band", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursdays"}]}
{"id": "t174-011", "text": "Spoke to Aisha on the phone. Her husband Hamza starts at the engineering firm in a fortnight, and they're moving to Bristol the week after. She's excited but worried about finding a school for their kids, especially the youngest, who has only just settled where they are. Hamza's boss has said he can work from home for the first month, which helps. Remind me to send Aisha the list of schools my cousin recommended before Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the engineering firm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about finding a school", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "can work from home", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Aisha the list of schools my cousin recommended", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t174-014", "text": "Samir finished his last shift at the restaurant yesterday. He's starting a pastry course in January 2027. Remind me to ask him how the first week goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last shift at the restaurant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pastry course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the first week goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t174-020", "text": "Zofia's daughter has her grade five piano exam next Thursday. Zofia says she's practising for hours every evening and barely sleeping.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade five piano exam", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t174-023", "text": "Hassan left the bank after eleven years and is going freelance. He sounded relieved more than anything. His first big client meeting is next Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hassan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "left the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first big client meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t174-024", "text": "Had coffee with Claire and Lena. Claire is training for the Dublin marathon and Lena has joined a ceramics class on Tuesday nights. Lena says the wheel is much harder than it looks and she's made nothing but wonky bowls so far. Claire's race is on Sunday 25 October, and she's aiming for under four hours. Her knee has been playing up, though, and she's worried she'll have to pull out halfway.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dublin marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ceramics class", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday nights"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "race", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday 25 October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "aiming for under four hours", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee has been playing up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried she'll have to pull out halfway", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t174-026", "text": "Zoe is struggling at the new job. Her manager keeps moving deadlines and she's thinking of handing in her notice in the new year. Her boyfriend thinks she should leave now rather than wait, and she has been crying in the car before work. She has an informal chat with a recruiter on Thursday. I should take her out for lunch soon, and remind me to ask how the recruiter call went on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handing in her notice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "crying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before work"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "informal chat with a recruiter", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for lunch", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the recruiter call went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t174-031", "text": "Remind me to call Santiago the day after his performance review on Friday. He's convinced it's going to go badly.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Santiago", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "performance review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "convinced it's going to go badly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t174-033", "text": "Phoebe's mum is having her hip replacement on 3 December. Phoebe will be staying with her for a fortnight afterwards, so she'll be off work. I should check how they're both doing that weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how they're both doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t174-036", "text": "Talked to Marisol for ages tonight. Her sister Carmen has just found out she's expecting, due in May. Marisol is going to be an aunt for the first time and keeps sending me pictures of tiny cardigans she wants to knit. She also told me she's applying for the deputy manager role at the garden centre, with interviews in the week of 23 November. I said I'd help her practise questions the weekend before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the week of 23 November", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t174-038", "text": "Wiremu's first day as a ranger at the national park is tomorrow. Text him tomorrow evening to ask how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day as a ranger at the national park", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t174-040", "text": "Hamza's brother Samir is getting married on 12 June 2027 in Lahore. Hamza is the best man and is already panicking about the speech.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 June 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}]}
{"id": "t174-043", "text": "Manon is obsessed with Formula One and has a Ferrari cap she never takes off. She's going to the Abu Dhabi race this year with her brother Samir, which has been the plan since they were teenagers. They fly out on Thursday 3 December and come back the following Tuesday. She has also started a fantasy league at work and is, by her own admission, terrible at it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula One", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a Ferrari cap", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Abu Dhabi race", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since they were teenagers"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fly out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday 3 December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Tuesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fantasy league", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t174-044", "text": "Naledi said the job offer from the hospital fell through, so the move to Cape Town is off for now. She's staying put and trying to stay positive.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job offer from the hospital fell through", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying put", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t174-046", "text": "Ilse is coeliac and doesn't drink, so bear that in mind for the dinner on 7 November. Her partner Kemal eats anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ilse", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bear that in mind", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats anything", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t174-047", "text": "Noor has started her PhD in marine biology and is spending most of the term in Plymouth. She seems happy but a bit lonely.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD in marine biology", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "spending most of the term in Plymouth", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "happy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit lonely", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t174-048", "text": "Kiara's band are playing their first proper gig at the Lantern on 21 November 2026. She's the drummer and says she feels sick every time she thinks about it. Remind me to message her good luck that afternoon, and to book tickets for me and Zoe tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first proper gig at the Lantern", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "feels sick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book tickets for me and Zoe", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t174-050", "text": "Eli loves Studio Ghibli films and draws fan art of the characters. His favourite is Howl's Moving Castle. A framed print might be a nice present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli films", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "draws fan art", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Howl's Moving Castle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "framed print might be a nice present", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t174-052", "text": "Alana and her husband have a new rescue dog called Juno. They're taking her to puppy classes on Saturday mornings.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new rescue dog called Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "puppy classes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday mornings", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t174-053", "text": "Hassan Ahmed from the five-a-side team has been offered a coaching job with the under-twelves. He hasn't decided yet but said he'll let me know by the end of next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hassan Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "five-a-side team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a coaching job with the under-twelves", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of next week"}]}
{"id": "t174-056", "text": "Lena got into the community choir she auditioned for. Rehearsals start next Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the community choir", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rehearsals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
